I woke up this morning.
It is raining heavily outside.
The intense heat in Kochi has broken.
Finally, the rainy season has started here.
But, I am not feeling well at all today.
My body feels very tired.
My head hurts badly.
I drank some water from the table.
My throat has a lot of pain too.
When swallowing water, my throat hurts terribly.
I think I have a fever.
Today is a weekday.
But I cannot go to the office.
I cannot take the bus to Infopark in this rain.
I must rest at home today.
I must see a doctor soon.
